{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8001_p", "source_sha256": "88f21ae4bc702e5a0530c0752a6c3c82986c3b8c616d93163987fbd3b51d79c5", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア\n撮影。ロコのテーマは『闇ナース』だ）", "zh": "（今天要为偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》拍摄写真。\nROCO的主题是“暗黑护士”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8002_025roc", "source_sha256": "8eb90ff6d5489249b23bc9eff18d57204b3d5a923f704c05262f85b0bda988d7", "ja": "むむむ、ダークネスナースのアティチュードは、\nなかなかディフィカルトです……。", "zh": "唔唔唔，暗黑护士的态度，\n相当困难呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8003_p", "source_sha256": "f786e655452dc2169db020ca2b57f10a21440be3a16bc3159b912270850f8b31", "ja": "そうだな……。いろんな方向性があると思うけど、\nロコが見えているのはどんな感じだ？", "zh": "是啊……我觉得可以有很多不同的方向，不过，你觉得ROCO应该呈现出怎样的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8004_025roc", "source_sha256": "b7a40f5339371e07cce839f2f7fe162d7b359a50e98319ef04e1209b4e0b0e98", "ja": "ホラーテイストではあるんですけど……。\nそれだけだとインパクトに欠けますよね？", "zh": "虽然是恐怖风格……但光是这样，冲击力还不够吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8005_025roc", "source_sha256": "05b9d489cd6ca13def8393be052f20552bcf653b838326e23e8b03b290ee773d", "ja": "ロコはこの撮影をマグニフィセントにするための、\nファクターが欲しいんです。", "zh": "ROCO想要一个能让这次拍摄变得更加精彩的关键要素。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8006", "source_sha256": "b1c10b1f442dc1fdbf95f8bc999db66d9323300c15f6f110585201653ad1544f", "ja": "ナースらしい優しさ", "zh": "护士般的温柔", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8007", "source_sha256": "a4feef30b52edc396840d34e4156455bc559a1da8996e091bebd326eaaba00a5", "ja": "もっとダークに", "zh": "更暗黑一些", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8008", "source_sha256": "2aa58f45e997c8492fbd522293147163f1a54bad146390d605c99b3c1e4abe9c", "ja": "笑いの要素を", "zh": "搞笑元素", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8100_p", "source_sha256": "2a6b9b2c6cac3d116dddb80436dec68c9f4696475ab5133fde48acd990f0d5d7", "ja": "ナースらしい優しさを入れてみるのはどうかな？\n優しさって、時には怖いものだったりするし。", "zh": "要不要试着加入一些护士般的温柔呢？\n温柔有时候也会让人害怕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8101_025roc", "source_sha256": "7e952b04bb956d8fdac9d9bf33703dd331c5020bb9d5704f12e2eef159238aad", "ja": "ダークネスとカインドネスのフュージョン……！\nナイスです、{$P$}！", "zh": "黑暗与温柔的融合……！很棒，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8102_025roc", "source_sha256": "7bb29a488fcb85fed704a41b23cab32b14d5996eba375703dab01f1c0cd95a02", "ja": "「このホスピタルにずっといてくださいね？　そのため\nならどんなことでもしますから♪」……どうですか？", "zh": "“请一直待在这家医院里，好吗？为了这个，我什么都愿意做哦♪”……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8200_p", "source_sha256": "cca2fa9fe65a5035d4566b385e0f8a4920ce93b25676dccfd3136bc9f2d47eb4", "ja": "闇の要素を深堀りしてみるのもいいんじゃないかな。\n闇、と言ってもいろんな方向性があるわけだし。", "zh": "再深入挖掘一下黑暗的元素，或许也不错。\n虽说是黑暗，但也有各种不同的方向嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8201_025roc", "source_sha256": "6a6c9745265b7c1461229ca599ffa9c0802b92468ed4132d596de799b2392bd8", "ja": "ダークを……。それなら、ビジュアルだけでなく\nマインドももっとダークネスに……ふ、ふふふっ……。", "zh": "黑暗风……既然这样，那就不只是视觉效果，连内心也要更加黑暗……呵、呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8202_025roc", "source_sha256": "e5fd98c4c6df51a126e51f7386d9069af4122ae55e3919663199962f179086b6", "ja": "イメージしただけで、クリーピーです。クレイジーな\nナースさんがいるなんて……あわわ～っ！？", "zh": "光是想象一下就觉得毛骨悚然。居然有疯狂的护士……啊哇哇～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8300_p", "source_sha256": "e6dcdd0adfb312f52a877a480626d25b1fbd4536a8394df2473d7fde309f215e", "ja": "お笑い要素……とか？　少なくとも、\n意外性はあると思う。あまり想像つかないけど……。", "zh": "搞笑元素……之类的？至少，我觉得还是有出人意料的地方。虽然不太能想象出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8301_025roc", "source_sha256": "57a956dc0570ac624de42789dcc18c39383d73a3ed0776845f5bcf0ca4232788", "ja": "コミカルに、ですか？　ホラーとコミカル……。\nうーん……ロコは、ミスマッチだと思います……。", "zh": "搞笑一点，是吗？恐怖和搞笑……\n嗯……ROCO觉得，这两种风格不搭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_8302_025roc", "source_sha256": "289c6125d8cad7d5dfc07430255c45779559a3f14da80b331e82711bd56f051c", "ja": "今日の{$P$}は、\nノーセンスですね。ふぅ。", "zh": "今天的{$P$}真是毫无格调呢。呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
